{"group_identity":"c653a78434272f3bbbeaec0f3686543345a808482327ed825772fd2783f5f768","payload":{"attempt":1,"contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1_lane_group","cycle":0,"group_id":"group-000","lane_boundaries":[{"index":1,"length":20,"offset":0},{"index":2,"length":20,"offset":20},{"index":3,"length":20,"offset":40},{"index":4,"length":20,"offset":60}],"lane_count":4,"lanes":[{"candidate_identity":"55b780ff92850c0e89f852033f45da240dd3baaf69eee5ec207bfb5c24c88c00","dispatch_id":"lane-000-0","index":1,"input_path":".ai/task/batch-6268429d52189447eb5d/SURFACE-SCREEN-ENVELOPE-lane-000-0.json"},{"candidate_identity":"075f9433c2040d288d2ce40408169abe3dac2f73bf65669fe2573e7ef263016b","dispatch_id":"lane-000-1","index":2,"input_path":".ai/task/batch-6268429d52189447eb5d/SURFACE-SCREEN-ENVELOPE-lane-000-1.json"},{"candidate_identity":"bba75997afa5c0b883544df385076c81f6615099fc8b0153056efa24ba762224","dispatch_id":"lane-000-2","index":3,"input_path":".ai/task/batch-6268429d52189447eb5d/SURFACE-SCREEN-ENVELOPE-lane-000-2.json"},{"candidate_identity":"528be34602f41c18d2d54dca7e76f6ef9c07f1cabec209703fac01b8361afc29","dispatch_id":"lane-000-3","index":4,"input_path":".ai/task/batch-6268429d52189447eb5d/SURFACE-SCREEN-ENVELOPE-lane-000-3.json"}],"review_phase":"REVIEW","task_id":"batch-6268429d52189447eb5d","workset":{"entries":[{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"36d1f7214bc23cb2dd210912d2fe402e58ed5329f64235e6984a593d6536d0b3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"061bb7726bdaf9218ad23cb7c3498ebe5cf9d9000fbfc99cd6c44cf6369fdeae","logical_entry_identity":"7ad1501c49f1fbc483273a18d83ea47b51d1a345a3a3d1356b5d4aa2d5ee5bc9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A lopsided, heavy emerald with murky green clouds shifting sluggishly under the surface.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一块不规则的厚重翡翠，表面之下有暗绿色的云纹缓缓浮动。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"39a891c9821d6e46e7a9d63ba75d250aebf79a700ce033cdc199babb178427ae","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0cf34fc9e87e2b071734b872ba5bd56a89ceea1baf96e7d8509fe4f1f8f789e0","logical_entry_identity":"d395e3eba334b146f8ee810ba595de02f5830fa4a105ef7f32096eccee5b30f5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Blacker than the deepest night, this cold cruel form of darkness approaches.  Long ago it laid aside its mortality, but it has not forgotten its power; rather, its malice and hate have bent this undead entity on the destruction of all things living.","source_tag":"_t","target":"比最深沉的暗夜还要漆黑，这个冰冷残忍的黑暗形体正在逼近。很久以前它抛弃了自己的凡躯，但并未忘却自身的力量；恰恰相反，它的恶意与仇恨驱使这个不死存在一心毁灭所有活物。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b6c593942c344ae0b74d3c7aeb1688b77adc78f79161e2735f4c3400875fdc02","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0d432529a62971889887fff4986226387620d4cea4033ba50310d4b115b3c522","logical_entry_identity":"7e8d2b00e1fa7f112c8e1094dfda8f14361e360b55c8dcc6ce30dba840d31222","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You are so full with power that it overflows out of you whenever you cast a spell.\n\t\tUpon spell cast you have %d%% chances to boost the physical power, spellpower, mindpower and all saves of all friendly undeads in sight (including yourself) by %d for 4 turns.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你的力量如此强大，每当你释放法术的时候，你的力量会喷涌而出。\n\t\t使用法术时，你有 %d%% 几率强化周围所有可见的友方不死生物（包括你自己），物理强度、法术强度、精神强度，所有豁免提升 %d，持续 4 回合。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fe4aea8bef09516cc0686e4185a1e0b74fb82930babb0a34055f76feaaa6dd61","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"10a9d9642cfcdd6ccfabdf2a30fa8e3f0d60d1b4af688c00f48c0ff6a0fc59ce","logical_entry_identity":"9ddc1d4057afbeadb6335b304f9df2d063263199ce8a4a08d803ee1a8adaa71d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Though you may fight alone against many, destined to fight till you die, still you do not relent. In a ring of blood you learn that a pair of fists can face the world.","source_tag":"_t","target":"纵使你独自一人面对千军万马，注定战至最后一刻，你依然绝不退缩。在鲜血之环中，你学会了一双拳头就足以面对整个世界。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c0d04857a52c282fe8923e3076dbafde44bb2b6c2882f681cf345733fc10a3c2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"305a28505f0a616ed8ecc1538f14da089ee8109f303f801ca35ddcfa7eab4dc5","logical_entry_identity":"413916534edb9a50784077d07c0824f8ad189ad1ce61ba63d8d4ca5f0a48817d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The balance of the heavens' powers is a daunting task. Mighty are those that stand in the twilight places, wielding both light and darkness in their mind.","source_tag":"_t","target":"平衡天空的力量是一件令人望而生畏的任务。强大的是那些驻足于暮光之境的人，心中同时驾驭着光明与黑暗的力量。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e66f45e9a93aef774d98687ed991dc52349cefce622c26bd75b7c24ce33f9bd8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"39f9cd5f7584ba6d7fcafe529dabda7fc053470cd3e274dd82b5b61281ab73af","logical_entry_identity":"b96a21efc85ae7d13a293d5c8dbcf77d728fb98a5a7fd5e78d50b2ac48271495","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Said to have once belonged to Inquisitor Marcus Dunn during the Spellhunt this fist sized quartz crystal glows constantly with a soft white light and was rumoured to be a great aid in meditation, helping focus the mind, body, and soul of the owner as well as protecting them from the foulest of magics.\nIt seems somebody well versed in antimagic could use it to its fullest potential.","source_tag":"_t","target":"据说曾属于魔法狩猎时期的审判官玛库斯·丹。这个拳头大小的石英晶体不断散发出柔和的白光，据说是冥想的极佳辅助，能帮助持有者凝聚精神、身体和灵魂，还能保护他们免遭最邪恶的魔法侵蚀。\n似乎只有精通反魔法的人才能发挥它的全部潜能。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7c51d49ef81b0b7188dbd2c7c38d4f8f3e7910d2c9beaae86fb1811f8bc7ff49","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3a8f14f6e32d18e802f661f9ea23d8e1b84bd506b34c6011060c001ae86e7295","logical_entry_identity":"69d0136f125237349392d783f15487ef50e9cc260120a38472d263dc6d07eca4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Player is being hunted! Randomly all foes in a radius will get a feeling of where she/he is","source_tag":"_t","target":"玩家处于被捕猎的状态，随机地，一定半径内的所有敌人都会感知到你所在的位置。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7c77ec937ea88de4b6448c8fed0bc8e19eac346ef0218d8b60a395c92dba9f4e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"40a06b029ca459a5d7aa2739d7f66927675c4e76d107593f1facc566f72db178","logical_entry_identity":"815f538a91ad35be4fa83be49ced8040149c165956ea5dc61b5b76dd183668ce","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You learn to finely craft and tune your spells, reducing all their cooldowns by %d%%.\n\t\tIn doing so you can also carve a hole in spells that affect an area to avoid damaging yourself.  The chance of success is %d%%.\n\t\tIn addition, you hone your damaging spells to spellshock their targets. Whenever you deal damage with a spell you attempt to spellshock them with %d more Spellpower than normal. Spellshocked targets suffer a temporary 20%% penalty to damage resistances.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你学会巧妙控制和调谐你的法术，降低 %d%% 法术冷却时间。\n\t\t此外，你可以控制自己的攻击性魔法，尝试在攻击范围中留出空隙，避免伤及自身。成功概率为 %d%%。\n\t\t此外，你还能磨练你的伤害法术，尝试对目标施加法术冲击。每当你用法术造成伤害时，你会尝试以比正常高出 %d 点的法术强度对目标施加法术冲击。被法术冲击的目标暂时减少 20%% 伤害抗性。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8776643eb3a34b591f2cd0bc18677c1f2f16389265a729611b6d26eb80ee5afb","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5f6149aeab6aed3ad6ec8c1856ace28e4f2fa8a701b37f238d0cb98b027fff70","logical_entry_identity":"e06a9d75931ba6636a12bb3dacdd0f54cf22206286601a98073ece6681d9f2a1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Some rookie paradox mage is about to find out that the standard-issue Temporal Reprieve takes you to a random safe-zone, not a fixed one, and left the contents of their pack strewn about the place. Nearly all of it is equipment that your transmutation chest won't process and is unusable by anything with less than twelve limbs, so you kick most of it into the void, but a crumpled note catches your eye...","source_tag":"_t","target":"某个新手时空法师马上就会发现，标准的时空避难所会把你传送到一个随机的安全区域，而不是固定的地方，而这位法师已经把背包里的东西散落在了此处。这些装备几乎都是你的转化之盒处理不了的、没有十二条肢体根本用不了的东西，所以你把大部分踢进了虚空，但一张皱巴巴的笔记引起了你的注意……"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"65d7cc407a31133b98c2e3fd91b7046bc142bb93da7f1a851b517012680daa83","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6c8a9fea370a04350ee3f122a241eacb1605db58118c7b78edc76f4914583429","logical_entry_identity":"f5c34b2d6db98881f3255733b968b96ad97e6f8c3519ad9d5be73b11ee5687ce","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Fires a beam that turns matter into dust, inflicting %0.2f temporal damage and %0.2f physical (warp) damage.\n\t\tAlternatively you may target yourself, creating a field of radius %d around you that will inflict the damage over three turns.\n\t\tThe damage will scale with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"发射一道射线，令物质归于尘土，造成 %0.2f 时空伤害与 %0.2f 物理（扭曲）伤害。\n\t\t也可以以自己为目标，制造一个围绕自己 %d 码的领域，在 3 回合内造成伤害。\n\t\t伤害受法术强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3ea8c109f60c1791c4d40ac23ff829d5e09ad80c47a558727678dee8d7f65504","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"892e7f4e81370143ec27a52531486274cfa8096cc53522c812780b61f5a630e8","logical_entry_identity":"b4787c16ec008b125909287251a8d4eb9e68a100d3b92e13c5789346abbaf767","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Your body is more like that of an ooze, you can split into two for %d turns.\n\t\tYour original self has the original ooze aspect while your mitosis gains the acid aspect.\n\t\tIf you know the Oozing Blades tree all the talents inside are exchanged for those of the Corrosive Blades tree.\n\t\tYour two selves share the same healthpool.\n\t\tWhile you are split both of you gain %d%% all resistances.\n\t\tResistances will increase with Mindpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你的身体变的像软泥怪一样，你可以分裂成2个，持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t你的本体获得原始的软泥特性，而分裂体则获得酸性特性。\n\t\t如果你习得软泥之刃系技能树，则该技能树会变为腐蚀之刃技能树。\n\t\t你和分裂体共享生命。\n\t\t当你分裂时，你和分裂体增加 %d%% 所有抵抗。\n\t\t抵抗受精神强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2df8a9c566d0fdd2635e85226065b20485db204d64900db07244b996c16a1228","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8a8598f645f055b3a39195b468ea7a9af0033f906173a1ff2d87f74b04db9c9b","logical_entry_identity":"e612c8997d0bb7a1e00c9abbb7418a36bef19e9f3d99d6824728227b677e6c63","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%s resists the temporal shear!","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"%s 抵挡了时空切变！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"002304ea402f965946c38cdc279a3c3714d5f6918ece03ea702f2a5797ddbb7b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9f4cf26e6b0c33cc6c85d88ff714e261886e91f1459e66bbc997183523360d1b","logical_entry_identity":"f8e7ff4bb84ac34856697dfe9bdc99213bdbf4b526273fa4b98de1297a2747c2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD#Mental critical chance#LAST#\nEach time you deal damage with a mental attack you may have a chance to perform a critical hit that deals extra damage.\nSome talents allow you to increase this percentage.\nIt is improved by Cunning.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD#精神暴击#LAST#\n每次以精神攻击造成伤害时你都有一定几率暴击造成额外伤害。\n一些技能可以提高这个几率。\n提升灵巧属性值可以提高精神暴击。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a44e022c3412086162ea71293b2999819541a1998e54a25caba97cc13bade993","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a71351bcfef24e33061a78ca74596558010a69613ba9a67aa57d65f646dc0f8f","logical_entry_identity":"1e2c31894708659f425e1b8023d2a02911eb6f1f12aec598b2587e873233fc97","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"With some advanced preparation, you learn to create and equip a second tool (at #YELLOW#level %d#WHITE#):\n\n%s\nPreparing a tool sets its talent level and puts it on cooldown.\nOnly one tool of each type can be equipped at a time.\n","source_tag":"tformat","target":"经过充分准备，你学会制造并装备第二件工具（#YELLOW#等级 %d#WHITE#）：\n\n%s\n准备工具会将其技能等级设为本技能等级，并使其进入冷却。\n每种类型同时只能装备一件工具。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fba221662840b59ebfdfaef63dfaf702535dddac1cc6e4de790195ab11aa8df9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a7237e1f8ccf11e2517971dfaebc2cee327051ee986c6eefba9660576620a8a2","logical_entry_identity":"20e1583f14fc99cafff2864d59e36a73a514f793daf23a29ba4ab2a8adad9cd2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Arkul's Siege Arrows","source_tag":"entity name","target":"阿库尔的攻城矢"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"26cce917b9a8d5ba65975de3e42917eb24962adb76e307fd48f2314bd42ff150","component":"