75b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Curse of Death","source_tag":"talent name","target":"死亡诅咒"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"57a853f3c6d20b6abfcbd61dbf18877a755919946536653ba91bf4a07dc0fbd5","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a7c19652781fd43a401f6e0c27a304639807d56cdd8eed6648da237f1b6e5e72","logical_entry_identity":"6f94187d5afb69d13f35d6da638db8681f421997bb7d2ec6fb5fc193958aaa7b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You'd think I could get one of these from a local hunter, but they've had no luck. Don't get eaten.","source_tag":"_t","target":"你认为我可以从本地的猎户手上取得它吗？甭想了，他们没那个运气。不要被吃掉了。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d2f557f8c9f227e0d9fc0e10ddadf1c26d16e6c5c921ab55c5574749887d5496","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a7c3c0be5b5b2ef03e8ad7319f567467946b0f031f24fd5c6bba371f0e3d0e47","logical_entry_identity":"0dc25be0c8d0c64cf238560777290b7604d15e2c1816028a3bf315236f941485","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":", and teaches you enhanced mental discipline needed to maintain powerful energy fields","source_tag":"_t","target":"，并传授你维持强大能量场所需的强化精神修养"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c1a515a94d1edc9265143f6554244a3f5632292b59ef0b9f9a4b9fd45d1a65e2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a7d0e910e4780abdf1deaea60da42242962bb18a36ad52bfb3388fc93aeb7dac","logical_entry_identity":"e0400f3f1e598d29f4cacc017e7a5633ebec1f68d23b2a1fea9c5910ad3adc08","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This huge white bear has wandered south in search of food.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这只巨大的白熊正在向南寻找食物。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a01db8b8ffad1385770dacf6dbc1812006759a41ad337f27713bf9981d6159f5","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a7d761637d6c56ada7863b3e33e4dcf0aa64adbbe40cbda37fd7457feb5b09e5","logical_entry_identity":"276465818434f5e0a536cdd5339bfb96a03c1e4771416056d177738727ce9218","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#{italic}#3. Unwanted Attention#{normal}#\n\nSadly, it is not only the peasantry and our \"virtuous\" archmage cousins that disapprove of our work. Though not entirely understood, necromancy is known to create \"ripples\" of a sort across the many dimensions, ripples that attract extra-planar attention. As a necromancer's power grows, so do said ripples, until eventually said necromancer finds all manner of demonic force and entity beating down their door, both mentally and physically.\n\nOnce again, opinions differ on this demonic interference. Necromancy is such a beautiful, divergent art, is it not? The Tren? method sees the necromancer's corruption by outside forces as a negative thing, and practitioners of said method often take measures to divert supernatural attention from themselves, creating talismans to act as spiritual \"conductors\" or living close to the communities that despise them, the life essences of the masses masking the necromancer's dark emanations. On the other hand, the Beinagrind method welcomes the cursed whisperings that come from the demonic realms, believing it to be the completion of their psyches. Only once their spirits have been \"corrupted\" (a term Beinagrind practitioners scoff at) do people realize their true ambitions, they claim. Why these \"true ambitions\" always seem to be the utter and complete destruction of all life in this world and the summoning of unthinkable atrocities from the outer dimensions is unexplored.\n\nYou may have noticed that no instruction has been given on how to deal with the attention of common folk. That is because a true necromancer requires none. They are vermin, fit only to be crushed.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#{italic}#3. 不受欢迎的关注#{normal}#\n\n遗憾的是，并非只有平民和我们自诩“高尚”的大法师同道反对我们的事业。虽然人们尚未完全理解其中原理，但已知死灵法术会在诸多位面之间激起某种“涟漪”，招来位面之外的关注。死灵法师的力量越强，涟漪也越强，最终形形色色的恶魔力量与实体都会找上门来，从精神和肉体两方面破门而入。\n\n对于这种恶魔干涉，各家意见再次出现分歧。死灵法术正是如此美妙而多姿多彩的艺术，不是吗？崔恩流派认为，死灵法师被外来力量腐化绝非好事。该派修习者常设法把超自然力量的注意引向别处，例如制作护符充当精神“导体”，或居住在憎恶他们的社区附近，借芸芸众生的生命精华掩盖死灵法师散发的黑暗气息。另一方面，贝纳格雷德流派欣然接纳来自恶魔领域的诅咒低语，相信它们能使心智臻于完整。他们声称，唯有精神受到“腐化”（贝纳格雷德修习者对这个词嗤之以鼻），人们才会认清自己真正的野心。至于这些“真正的野心”为何总是彻底毁灭世间一切生命，并从外层位面召来难以想象的恐怖之物，至今无人探究。\n\n你或许已经注意到，本书没有说明如何应付普通人的关注。真正的死灵法师根本不需要这种指导。那些人不过是害虫，只配被碾碎。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d71ccb681f7990e7345747d0a0720fb9bce42c0dea740777c250a10b37db1697","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a7d981032cde73e1f97d7b63b0c71ef982274007296fcc282dba0cc507b35b32","logical_entry_identity":"df233328f422e0fe598d2b3bb05ac5d0328071dae0353e025822a77037ca3c24","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You call upon an eerie night to aid you for %d turns.\n\t\tEach turn you automatically fire a beam of darkness towards a random foe (prioritizing the ones further away) that deals %0.2f darkness damage and has 25%% chance to blind any foes caught inside for 4 turns.\n\t\tThe damage will increase with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你呼唤黄昏降临，持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t每回合随机发射一束暗影光线（优先攻击最远的敌人），造成 %0.2f 暗影伤害，并有 25%% 几率致盲敌人 4 回合。\n\t\t伤害受法术强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bbe44973c8da891c778a649012ed5f40033828bed466bab136f347227fcda656","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a7e1a73ff5d64a7cbb16d486d1ef5cee81dbdb23e26f9aecb01022faa254f417","logical_entry_identity":"135bfcda1c5210937f1ae0f8bc31d34eb43176233b1e136024c2fd8423a4abca","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"cunning","source_tag":"talent category","target":"灵巧"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7b6bfad0427d9049a8b8631f90384e47b6b9aaeba88bfc1f8038bfeb061b38cc","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a7e79812ebfe965b2b70547208912fb0cee07d2115170a9d19544920a208820f","logical_entry_identity":"93ebaebbc37d6308b6f73a6d7b0d4c0f39787c1535f665b7a06981b8941c635d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Anomaly Entomb","source_tag":"talent name","target":"异常：埋葬"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9d4227dd12865f5f6afafaac2021dcd7decce70449c596efa752991ae004b8a7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a7e858deedf6af4872176b5ee7faf37908b2b8d1738d22dc5ec40eaa5b1e0b9c","logical_entry_identity":"4aa270cc728f112433c39a1634e5a1c10462e41e904fc420520f809791c0676c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%d Fateweaver","source_tag":"tformat","target":"%d 命运编织"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ece29064bed1f5020faf12410f50021207a9d20ebedc0c7d526a78cae841e9bb","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a7e93f3c2e3c9dcdff2b4443e2b134248d7c12421a60799c1b647d71f1bc4e96","logical_entry_identity":"50b2a53f01899b6c4c00cf17a36b2538e17556f8892f3912e103f11c9304298a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The target stands strong, increasing all resistances by %0.1f%% and resistance caps by %0.1f%%.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标十分强大，增加全体抗性 %0.1f%%, 全体抗性上限 %0.1f%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d8b84a8247a4aadd166d422d3e4aea60c9fb58c68da17e4e6bef7217d6ac0bcc","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a7e957d31887583b2148790b1ff3c589ae4bca70fab5441da0ed8fd809fa0025","logical_entry_identity":"dd42a293adcad675fa261b920aa07b220fe617cadbed65636ee38db650fedc89","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD#Equilibrium#LAST#\nEquilibrium reflects your standing in the grand balance of nature and how easily you can access Wild Gifts.\nThe closer it is to 0 the more in-balance you are.\nBeing too far out of balance may cause your Wild Gifts to fail when called upon.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD#失衡值#LAST#\n失衡值是你保持自然平衡的能力，决定了你使用野性系技能的难易程度。\n失衡值越接近于0你破坏自然平衡的量越少。\n当你的失衡值过高时会影响你使用野性系技能。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6e6645d9ac0109071d7be96c63499c3a9e4c8987a5767e360d9d3fd1b6d63a17","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a7f043863f6c8aadbd339f9132ded19b66a6fd35ea885c58f21d6acdbfb22d89","logical_entry_identity":"01e6a65702ab8a1e7994d198bce4b827ec46779de60f51d6a57852ab3f288093","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"generic inc damage temporal","source_tag":"entity name","target":"通用 增加时空伤害"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9626629a43c83fc7b6bf6e7b6be94f1d64d7f80e7765f7136ffc6b481a9e3e15","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity